  "title": "Italian Bread Using a Bread Machine",
  "description": "Make two loaves of crusty Italian bread with this recipe that calls for making the dough in a bread machine and baking the loaves in the oven.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-09-12T14:17:41-04:00",
